                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayo ame abuto i ode daŋ omotowu, en ame gwoko lwak oye Kricito luŋ. Eracito akanlim me boma-ni, kede ominwa Kwarto daŋ omotowu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.23"
            ]
